      "statement": "Progress and bitrate UI updates are throttled by PROGRESS_UPDATE_UI_STEP (3 percentage points) using non-reactive stats mirrors, and pause/resume is implemented via a per-file stop flag where onContinue re-emits a synthetic RECEIVED_CHUNK event to restart the chunk loop.",
