    {
      "id": "claim_5024585bc4fd4034b5c20dcd04ae50c2",
      "statement": "On completion (receivedSize >= declared size) the receiver builds the file Blob immediately, deletes both per-file state maps, and releases the file's chunkQueue entry — releasing the raw per-chunk buffers so a large file is not held twice in memory.",
