    {
      "id": "claim_ba98a0d1c707452695012eef1aec6692",
      "statement": "Late or stray chunks are dropped, not fatal: onChunkData ignores chunks for unknown or uninitialized file ids (metadata never registered, file removed/denied, or already completed), and processChunk re-checks the chunk map after the decrypt await so a file removed/denied mid-flight is dropped without acking (an ack would advance the sender past a rejected file).",
