      "statement": "MetaData.size is int64 on the wire (PR #42 / commit 721c502; was int32), so files of 2 GiB or larger no longer throw 'invalid int32' during Message.encode; tests/protocol-size.test.mjs pins this by encoding and round-tripping 3 GiB and MAX_SAFE_INTEGER sizes through the generated proto code.",
