    {
      "id": "claim_74feef5391c348988bff4e02883d1887",
      "statement": "Chunk size is enforced numeric on two layers: Sender.sendNextChunk defensively coerces its chunkSize prop with Number() (32 KB fallback for non-finite/non-positive values) so a string from a <select> bind:value can no longer make offset + chunkSize concatenate and send the whole file remainder as one over-sized chunk, and OfferOptions.onChange coerces the select value with Number() and falls back to DEFAULT_SEND_OPTIONS.chunkSize when it is not in CHUNK_SIZE_OPTIONS, keeping sendOptions.chunkSize a number at the source.",
