      "statement": "The sender's document-level paste listener is scoped to file sharing: handlePasteEvent ignores events whose target is an INPUT, TEXTAREA, SELECT, or content-editable element, so pasting an answer code or custom ICE server value into any text field no longer silently adds a stray clipboard.txt to the sender file list, and onDestroy removes the listener so it never outlives the component.",
